{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2024-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1717200000, "end_date": 1719791999, "month_true_total": 10, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:54:40 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "168516322", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036986281", "personaname": "Felsphar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/felsphar/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 15, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14, "last_played": 1719965997, "avatar": "36aa07e643c87ab1f983d2457606df3963bf2a0e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I purchased this version of the game to jump back into multiplayer, but it straight up does not work. It requires connecting through Origin, which doesn't exist anymore, and even after directly contacting EA, they are either unable or unwilling to fix it. I spent half a day trying to troubleshoot but couldn't find a solution that worked.", "timestamp_created": 1719682982, "timestamp_updated": 1719682982, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.557451248168945312", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168350520", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961091900", "personaname": "AZ-Ancient Raider", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961091900/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 165, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 165, "last_played": 1719518279, "avatar": "398cac33560f962bd852cd1623a4ea8915f1e370"}, "language": "english", "review": "hard to load with ea and steam, constant problems with controls in game", "timestamp_created": 1719519778, "timestamp_updated": 1719519778, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.570732772350311279", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167574825", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118156399", "personaname": "Redrock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198118156399/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 2566, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2566, "last_played": 1718643430, "avatar": "a060363e6cce022b263eed863956766990b51c20"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great ending to a trilogy. I am happy that I had a chance to be a part of the story. Never cared so much for the characters in the game. Will continue with Andromeda, hope that more Mass Effect games will come. Thank you BioWare!", "timestamp_created": 1718643869, "timestamp_updated": 1718643869, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167464489", "author": {"steamid": "76561199125068076", "personaname": "Laniusss", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199125068076/", "num_games_owned": 74, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2063, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2063, "last_played": 1623912882, "avatar": "ee1bb3bb5898c6df1a4868022262fbc236f5ea2c"}, "language": "english", "review": "saddest and most epic to ever exist. ♥♥♥♥ everything else", "timestamp_created": 1718509127, "timestamp_updated": 1718509127, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_